and things aren't going quite so well as a Scout leader,

533
00:37:57,000 --> 00:38:02,000
what makes you keep at it?

534
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:06,000
What do you think about that kind of reanimates you and gets you moving again,

535
00:38:06,000 --> 00:38:10,000
Although we can take inspiration from people like Baden Powell,

536
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:13,000
and that certainly is one place to go.

537
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:17,000
but the other place to go is just to watch your boys,

538
00:38:17,000 --> 00:38:19,000
watch how they're interacting with one another

539
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:23,000
and reflect on the huge potential there

540
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:29,000
and that you as a Scout leader can have a major impact on their lives.

541
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:32,000
When you start thinking about that,

542
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:35,000
it's pretty hard to stay discouraged for long.

543
